    "text": "Two identical glass bulbs are interconnected by a thin glass tube. A gas is filled in these bulbs at NTP. If one bulb is placed in ice and another bulb is placed inside a hot bath, then the pressure of the gas becomes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math> times. The temperature of the hot bath will be<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0151_4db9a0ef0b0b.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 130px;\" />"
