  "solution": {
    "text": "Quantity of gas in these bulbs is constant, i.e.,<br />initial no. of moles in both the bulbs = final number of moles<br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>&#956;</mi> <mn>1</mn> </msub> <mo>+</mo> <msub> <mi>&#956;</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msub> <mo>=</mo> <msubsup> <mi>&#956;</mi> <mn>1</mn> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msubsup> <mo>+</mo> <msubsup> <mi>&#956;</mi> <mn>2</mn> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msubsup> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">PV</mtext><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">PV</mtext><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>1.5</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">PV</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>1.5</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">PV</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mtext><mfenced><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mtext>1.5</mtext><mi>T</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;&#160;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mn>1</mn><mn>9</mn><mo>K</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>"
